"crG" = (
/obj/item/paper{
	default_raw_text = "Nanotrasen made the wrong choice when they hired a bunch of khallas lihs to build this place. it's already bad enough that humans have no eyes for architectural design! I heard the ordnance lab is being shoved up to this level because the jara in charge of the service wing put the holodeck where we were going to put the launcher. Absolutely horrid. and whoever was in charge of research had to move xenobiology all the way over to here, moving MY office WAY over to be across the hall from medical. and the medical architect did NOT get the memo that the cloning program had been discontinued YEARS ago. awful. genuinely awful. I miss my parents. I was supposed to have a nice lab a stones throw away from the bar. Now I'm going to be cooped up in what is little more than a closet ALL the way over here. fuck my life!"
	},
